    "because": "C4's last sentence and FB-025 (node.ts, the drain's two sweeps): a pending VALUE is applied before a pending SIGNAL, whatever order they arrived in. Here the Counter's Start Value arrives one hop late (through a Log) while its Reset pulse arrives directly, so the pulse is queued first; the sweep applies Start Value = 1 before Reset, and the count lands on 1. A target that drains in arrival order resets to the OLD start (0) and reads 0. Beside fb-025-run-reads-the-value-beside-it.test.ts, gam-004-gate-reads-the-same-turn.test.ts, gam-011-a-value-sent-with-a-signal-arrives.test.ts.",
